### Health
GET http://localhost:8081/health

### Catalogo de servicios web del modulo
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/services

### Listar libros
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/books

### Buscar por categoria
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/books/search?category=Informatica

### Buscar por titulo
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/books/search?title=go

### Login
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "estudiante@example.com",
  "password": "secreto123"
}

### Usuario autenticado
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer PEGAR_TOKEN_AQUI

### Registrar libro
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Servicios Web con Go",
  "author": "Leonardo Sanchez",
  "category": "Informatica",
  "editorial": "UTM",
  "year": 2026,
  "description": "Libro de prueba para evidenciar servicios web REST.",
  "format": "PDF",
  "isbn": "978-9-998",
  "available": true,
  "file_path": "/books/servicios-web-go.pdf"
}

### Registrar descarga
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/downloads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "book_id": 1
}

### Historial de descargas
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/downloads/history
